,"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-p007-zhuge-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p007"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-o001-zhuge-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o001"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-p001-zhuge-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-p001"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huowang-q-df96241442ae09acfa45","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-16c2533477b122f48f5b","layer":"pei","quote":"朗少，师事司马德操。与徐元直、韩德高、庞士元皆亲善","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06d489ae4e8130ce5c53","start":11,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-o001a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-e3761acb8bdd6b822dd8","layer":"original","quote":"统弱冠往见徽。徽采桑于树上，坐统在树下。共语自昼至夜，徽甚异之，称统当为“南州士之冠冕〖4〗”。由是渐显。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-p001b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-67cdb392b3293b4195ae","layer":"pei","quote":"德操尝造德公，值其渡沔，上祀先人墓；德操径入其室，呼德公妻子，使速作黍：‘徐元直向云有客当来，就我与庞公谈。’其妻子皆罗列拜于堂下，奔走供设；须臾，德公还，直入相就：不知何者是客也。","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-952f093ecb11b9f464e8","start":73,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-p001e-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-67cdb392b3293b4195ae","layer":"pei","quote":"统，德公从子也。少未有识者，惟德公重之；年十八，使往见德操。德操与语，既而叹曰：‘德公诚知人！此实盛德也。’”","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-952f093ecb11b9f464e8","start":248,"end":303,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o001","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-e3761acb8bdd6b822dd8","layer":"original","quote":"庞统字士元，襄阳人也。少时朴钝〖1〗，未有识者〖2〗。颍川司马徽清雅有知人鉴〖3〗，统弱冠往见徽。徽采桑于树上，坐统在树下。共语自昼至夜，徽甚异之，称统当为“南州士之冠冕〖4〗”。由是渐显。﹝一﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-p001","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-67cdb392b3293b4195ae","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《襄阳记》曰：“诸葛孔明为‘卧龙’，庞士元为‘凤雏’，司马德操为‘水镜’，皆庞德公语也。德公，襄阳人。孔明每至其家，独拜床下，德公初不令止。德操尝造德公，值其渡沔，上祀先人墓；德操径入其室，呼德公妻子，使速作黍：‘徐元直向云有客当来，就我与庞公谈。’其妻子皆罗列拜于堂下，奔走供设；须臾，德公还，直入相就：不知何者是客也。德操年小德公十岁，兄事之，呼作庞公；故世人遂谓‘庞公’是德公名，非也。德公子山民，亦有令名。娶诸葛孔明小姊。为魏黄门、吏部郎，早卒。子涣，字世文。晋太康中，为牂牁太守。统，德公从子也。少未有识者，惟德公重之；年十八，使往见德操。德操与语，既而叹曰：‘德公诚知人！此实盛德也。’”","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-952f093ecb11b9f464e8","start":0,"end":303,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-efb1acb0b0e00bcdb986","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d5a485e53cadaed844f3","layer":"original","quote":"年十岁，戏于讲堂上；颍川司马德操拊其头曰〖2〗：“孺子，孺子，‘黄中通理〖3〗’，宁自知不","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p007a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-5e0c0e5a60ba22769a1d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《襄阳记》曰：“刘备访世事于司马德操。德操曰：‘儒生俗士，岂识时务！识时务者在乎俊杰；此间自有伏龙、凤雏。’备问：‘为谁？’曰：‘诸葛孔明、庞士元也！’”","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-97f720aac20414c2a4da","start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p007","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-5e0c0e5a60ba22769a1d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《襄阳记》曰：“刘备访世事于司马德操。德操曰：‘儒生俗士，岂识时务！识时务者在乎俊杰；此间自有伏龙、凤雏。’备问：‘为谁？’曰：‘诸葛孔明、庞士元也！’”","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-97f720aac20414c2a4da","start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
